Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for Molten Core \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 60 40man Molten Core]
[NX 60 40man Naxxramas]

Molten Core lies at the very bottom of Blackrock Mountain, the volcano between the Searing Gorge and the Burning Steppes. Lothos Riftwaker waits on a ledge in the mountain's lowest chamber, near the Blackrock Depths gate; once you are attuned he sends you straight into the raid. The raid's own portal is deep inside Blackrock Depths, past the Grim Guzzler. Unverified: Dungeon Journal marks Attunement to the Core as not in WoW Forever yet, while QuestieDB and Wowhead Forever still list it; check in game.

-- Left out: 6804, 6805, 6821, 6822, 6823, 6824 and 7486 (Duke Hydraxis chain, Azshara): it starts with level 56-57 world quests in the Eastern Plaguelands and Silithus, and 6823 needs Honored with the Hydraxian Waterlords, a reputation grind over many raid clears; too long for a raid guide. 6804, 6805, 6821 and 6822 have only level gates and can be done, but they are a far off-route Azshara round trip that ends at that rep gate, so the guide skips them too. 6821 Eye of the Emberseer was handed here by the Upper Blackrock Spire guide and is left out with the chain. 6642 to 6646: repeatable Thorium Brotherhood reputation turn-ins at Lokhtos Darkbargainer in Blackrock Depths, not a quest route. 8578 Scrying Goggles: part of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands chain; left out by every guide including Ahn'Qiraj (a 30-quest world chain with a reputation grind and the one-time gate event). 7604 A Binding Contract: Blacksmithing only.

