[A Horde][OC] East into Hillsbrad and north-east to Tarren Mill. Kirin Tor Guards and Southshore Defenders (level 55) stand by the road south of Tarren Mill, so keep away from them [G15.0,45.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G35.0,48.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G55.0,36.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G60.1,18.6 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Horde][OC] Follow the road south-east past Durnholde Keep to the gate in Thoradin's Wall [G58.5,34.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G62.0,41.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G83.7,60 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Horde][OC] Through the gate and east on the road to the crossing south of Refuge Pointe [G26.3,50.1 Arathi Highlands][G45.2,58.4 Arathi Highlands] \\ Stromgarde Cavalrymen and Lieutenant Valorcall (Alliance elites 36-38) ride near 33,52.
[A Horde][OC] South down the road to Thandol Span [G43.6,73.3 Arathi Highlands][G43.9,83.6 Arathi Highlands][G45.7,98.9 Arathi Highlands] \\ Modr (elite 32) wanders by the bridge.
[A Horde][OC] Cross Thandol Span and follow the road south to Dun Modr [G49.7,26 Wetlands]
[A Horde][OC] South along the river road to Dun Algaz [G57,49.5 Wetlands][G55.1,73.7 Wetlands] \\ Dragonmaw elites and Golm (28-32) stand near 56-58,49-54; Modr and Neru (elite 32) by Dun Modr.
[A Horde][OC] Through the Dun Algaz tunnel into Loch Modan and south on the east road, keeping clear of Thelsamar [G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G39.7,43.7 Loch Modan][G43.2,67.8 Loch Modan]
[A Horde][OC] South into the Badlands, then west across the plain to Kargath [G53.5,13.8 Badlands][G50.0,28.5 Badlands][G42,41 Badlands][G18,42 Badlands][G4.0,44.9 Badlands] \\ Shadowforge elites, a War Golem and Broken Tooth (35-40) near 52-54,15-20; a Siege Golem and the Malevolent Mirage (elite 40-42) near 36-40,41.
[A Horde] At Gorrik, get the Kargath flight path [P Kargath] [G4.0,44.9 Badlands] \\ Shadowforge elites, a War Golem and Broken Tooth (35-40) near 52-54,15-20; a Siege Golem and the Malevolent Mirage (elite 40-42) near 36-40,41.
[A Horde] South out of Kargath and west through the pass into the Searing Gorge [G4.0,44.9 Badlands][G2.0,56.7 Badlands][G80.0,48.2 Searing Gorge] [OC] \\ An Altruist Ward (60) stands near 2,45.
[A Horde] West along the road, then south-west to the Blackrock Mountain gate [G57.8,48.8 Searing Gorge][G47.7,65.9 Searing Gorge][G34.9,83.9 Searing Gorge] [OC] \\ Infernus Siege Giants (level 60) walk the road near 55,53, Lord Gazzran (62) and a Faulty War Golem (rare elite) stand near 45,68, and Obsidian Reavers and Surgers (55-60) guard the gate.

