-- Both factions: Lothos Riftwaker inside Blackrock Mountain.
Inside the mountain, take the path down to the lowest chamber and the ledge by the Blackrock Depths gate. Lothos Riftwaker gives [QA7848 Attunement to the Core] [G32.1,94.7 Searing Gorge] \\ Needs level 55. Cannot be shared (Dungeon Journal).
Enter Blackrock Depths and fight through to the Molten Core portal past the Grim Guzzler. Take the Core Fragment from the rock beside the portal [QC7848 Attunement to the Core] \\ Blackrock Depths is a level 52-60 dungeon: bring your group.
Back out of the Depths to Lothos Riftwaker [QT7848 Attunement to the Core] [G32.1,94.7 Searing Gorge] \\ From now on, Lothos can teleport you into Molten Core.

